OL,3,GNEWSAThird man arrested after fatal
OL,4,Ajewellery store raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third man has been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with a robbery at a
OL,8,FPeterborough jewellery shop after which
OL,9,Fthe owner died.
OL,11,FSix men targeted Lala Jewellers, on
OL,12,FGladstone Street, shortly before 12:00
OL,13,FGMT on 14 November, attacking Ansar
OL,14,FMahmood, according to Cambridgeshire
OL,15,FPolice.
OL,17,FMahmood, 55, of Eastfield Road, was
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital but died on 20
OL,19,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
