OL,3,GNEWSAThird man arrested after fatal
OL,4,Ajewellery store raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 48-year-old man from Grantham,
OL,7,FLincolnshire, was arrested on Thursday
OL,8,Fon suspicion of murder and robbery. He
OL,9,Fhas since been released on bail while
OL,10,Finquiries continue.
